WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.958
Toad, Mole, and Rat rode in the cart.

2
00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:09.787
They were tired and covered in dust.

3
00:00:09.788 --> 00:00:12.619
The sun was setting.

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:17.592
The sky was pink with the fading light.

5
00:00:17.593 --> 00:00:20.945
"Let's stop for the night," said Rat.

6
00:00:20.946 --> 00:00:24.221
"Yes, let's," said Mole.

7
00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:27.292
"Wonderful idea!" said Toad.

8
00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.443
"I'm hungry."

9
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:34.327
They stopped the cart and untied the horse.

10
00:00:34.328 --> 00:00:38.701
The stars came out in the dark sky.

11
00:00:38.702 --> 00:00:44.197
They ate a simple supper under the moon.

12
00:00:44.198 --> 00:00:47.346
"Time for bed," said Toad.

13
00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:51.998
He snuggled under his blanket on the grass.

14
00:00:51.999 --> 00:00:55.514
"What a great day!" he said.

15
00:00:55.515 --> 00:00:59.125
"So much better than that old river."

16
00:00:59.126 --> 00:01:05.625
Toad closed his eyes and began to snore.

17
00:01:05.626 --> 00:01:09.308
"Oh, my river," sighed Rat.

18
00:01:09.309 --> 00:01:17.501
"I miss it very much."

19
00:01:17.502 --> 00:01:21.882
Mole lay next to Rat.

20
00:01:21.883 --> 00:01:24.762
He squeezed Rat's paw.

21
00:01:24.763 --> 00:01:29.251
"Rat," said Mole, "should we run away tomorrow?

22
00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:32.058
We can go home to the river."

23
00:01:32.059 --> 00:01:34.048
"No," said Rat.

24
00:01:34.049 --> 00:01:36.362
"We have to stay with Toad.

25
00:01:36.363 --> 00:01:40.101
It would not be safe to leave him."

26
00:01:40.102 --> 00:01:43.862
Mole yawned. "Okay."

27
00:01:43.863 --> 00:01:48.655
"Toad's foolish ideas never last long," said Rat.

28
00:01:48.656 --> 00:01:50.453
Rat was right.

29
00:01:50.454 --> 00:01:55.957
Tomorrow everything would change.

30
00:01:55.958 --> 00:01:59.653
"Goodnight, Mole," yawned Rat.

31
00:01:59.654 --> 00:02:11.016
But Mole was already fast asleep.

